  "editorialChanges": [
    "Centered 4.5/5-second typing restored.",
    "Both prehistoric-human/fire shots removed.",
    "Narration rewritten around causes, questions and consequences.",
    "Voyager launch-era visual separated from 2012 heliopause.",
    "International Space Station explicitly named in the assembly narration and the wide orbital view.",
    "The forest dinosaur, full-station orbital view, station life, Philae landing and simultaneous Falcon recovery carry music alone.",
    "The storm dinosaur is replaced by a calm black deep-time bridge, narrated across a one-second fade into present-day night lights.",
    "A timed identification names early Earth approximately4.5billion years ago, only on its molten-globe shot.",
    "Apollo descent camera changed to verified source1254; surface EVA follows first step.",
    "Curiosity imagery grouped in final legacy passage; Perseverance introduced separately.",
    "The LRO-data Apollo17 flyover moved to the equipment-legacy conclusion.",
    "NewHorizons launch2006 omitted instead of mislabelling it as Pluto2015.",
    "Fewer transition sound effects; connected paragraph audio crosses cuts."
